+### Phase D7 — The Win32 personality port ✅ (measured 2026-11-05, RESIDUE3 C8)
 
 **Objective.** Run a *Win32* DOOM build through `w32run`.
 
-- [ ] Build `doomgeneric_win.c` with mingw-w64 against the W32 personality
